  "body": "This really is the valuable jewel you have been looking for!\r\n\r\nLess than a 45-minute drive from Auckland CBD, beachside living is available and affordable, with this property offering so much value for the astute purchaser.\r\n\r\n· 1239sqm Freehold Title\r\n\r\n· Direct beach access within a 1-minute walk with steps from your property\r\n\r\n· Elevated coastal views from the beachline across Big Manly Bay\r\n\r\n· Charming and refreshed 1950’s 2-bedroom Bach provides comfortable accommodation (town water supply)\r\n\r\n· Large sunbathing and entertaining deck\r\n\r\n· Separate garaging and storage for kayaks, surfboards or jetskis\r\n\r\n· Stunning sunsets are a regular feature\r\n\r\nBoaties will relish the easy access to boat ramps making the Hauraki Gulf your daily playground.\r\n\r\nPosition conscious buyers – here it is. So close to Auckland CBD and with the Penlink Highway under construction, the access to this property will be even more convenient, let alone the likely appreciation in value.\r\n\r\nAstute purchasers will see the value in securing such a rare purchase opportunity and the landbank or future realisation of value this idyllic property and setting offers. Subdivision possibilities are worthy of consideration (site services installed), with access from Tindalls Bay Road and road frontage on Brown Street.\r\n\r\nA myriad of choices are accessible from this location and can be enjoyed – with Tindalls Beach and Matakatia Beach both within a 5-minute walk, and a short stroll to the local café’s, restaurants, and shops of Manly village.\r\n\r\nWhy drive hours north or south to a holiday home that you seldom use (especially with today’s petrol costs), when you can have beachside living every day so close to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nSurprisingly affordable - CV $1,450,000. This coastal gem can be yours today!",
